values ($seed$turn-projects-into-recurring-income$seed$, 'workshop', $seed$Turn projects into recurring income$seed$, null, 180, 'live online', 350, 25, 'draft', 'invite', 5, 20, true, 50, 50,
  $seed${"summary":"Build legitimate ongoing work from the automations you deliver.","problem":"Automations need care after launch. Connected services change, volumes grow and businesses want improvements. Practitioners who stop at handover leave that work, and the income that comes with it, to someone else.","audience":"Practitioners with delivered projects who want more predictable income.","outcomes":["Identify the ongoing support a client's automations genuinely need.","Design support, monitoring and maintenance offers clients understand.","Price recurring services fairly for both sides.","Write a simple service agreement covering response times and limits.","Recognize recurring arrangements that would be unfair or unsustainable."],"series_fit":"Extends Workshops 01 and 08: pricing applied to ongoing services, built on a delivery the client already trusts."}$seed$::jsonb, $seed$get-paid-for-automation$seed$, 9, true, 'Imported from content/workshops/series as a planned workshop')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;
